248 - O, How I Love Jesus
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 248
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[G]There is a Name I love to hear, I love to sing its [F#dim]worth;
[Em]It sounds like music [G]in my ears, The sweetest Name on [D7]earth.
[G]O how I love Jesus, O how I love Jesus,
[G]O how I love Jesus, [F#dim]Because He first loved [Bm]me.

Refrain:
[G]O how I love Jesus,
[G]O how I love [D7]Jesus,
[G]O how I love Jesus,
[G]Because He first loved me.

Verse 2:
[G]It tells me of a Savior's love,
[Em]Who died [G]to set me free;
[G]It tells me of a Savior's blood,
[G]The sinners' [F#dim]perfect plea.

Verse 3:
[G]It tells of one whose loving heart
[Em]Can feel [G]my deepest woe;
[G]Who in each sorrow bears
[G]A part that [F#dim]none can bear below.
